1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Sgt. Kellar: We lost a lot of good people.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Interrogator: Battle school buddies, weren't they?

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Interrogator: Your team was ordered back after the mission.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Interrogator: McCarver convinced you otherwise?

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Interrogator: You had nothing to do with it?

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Sgt. Kellar: Yes.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Sgt. Kellar: I mean, no!

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Interrogator: You're [expletive] with me, so which is it?

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Sgt. Kellar: We all agreed to go after Lennox.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Interrogator: But Sergeant Solomon wanted out.

11
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Sgt. Kellar: He didn't take much persuading.

12
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Sgt. Kellar: Lennox needed to be stopped. He wasted my friends.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Interrogator: So what was the plan?
